  Modified for Android, 2026: shaders and spectral data are embedded in the
  library, the renderer runs on a host-provided Vulkan device and queue
  (queue access goes through host lock callbacks), video export paths with
  colour tables were added, GPUs that cannot filter 32-bit float textures
  blend the colour tables in the shader instead, and host-specific error
  messages were made generic.

